  "notes": "{従|したが}う is a godan verb meaning to follow, obey, or comply.\n\nKANJI:\n{従|したが/じゅう} means 'follow, obey, accompany'\n\nTHREE MAIN USES:\n1. To follow someone/something\n2. To obey rules or orders\n3. 〜に{従|したが}って: as ~, in proportion to ~\n\nGRAMMAR PATTERN:\n- Noun + に{従|したが}う: to obey/follow [noun]\n- Verb + に{従|したが}って: as [verb] (proportional change)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {規則|きそく}に{従|したが}う: to follow the rules\n- {指示|しじ}に{従|したが}う: to follow instructions\n- {法律|ほうりつ}に{従|したが}う: to comply with the law\n\nRELATED:\n{従業員|じゅうぎょういん} (employee) shares the same kanji",
